{"Categories":[8],"HiddenTopics":[26],"Topics":[9],"Id":39,"TextResource":{"Name":"danes","Translations":[{"Text":"Danés","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Danés","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":36}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Consolidado como un lugar para la familia, que busca resaltar las preparaciones tradicionales de nuestro país pero con un toque moderno. Especialistas en sándwiches, ensaladas y platos, además de sus postres y una sublime pastelería que le brinda una gran reputación entre los viajeros.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Consolidated as a family restaurant, Café Danés seeks to highlight traditional Chilean recipes with a modern touch. Specialties include sandwiches, salads and dishes, in addition to desserts and gorgeous pastries which have earned it a solid reputation among travelers.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916772","Updated":"1489712587","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/039_danes.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/367\/node\/310","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/367\/node\/310","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/039_danes.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/39\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/039_danes.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/39\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_restaurant_opening_hours"},{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_restaurant_phone"},{"key":"field_website","label":"Website","field_name":"field_restaurant_website"}]},"HasAddition